WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
<v Mia Wong>So the thing

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.500
<v Mia Wong>I wanted to raise today

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.900
<v Mia Wong>is that our release checklist

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.200
<v Mia Wong>is getting way too long.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Sam Lee>Agreed. Half of the items are automated now anyway.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.500
<v Sam Lee>I'll remove the automated ones by Friday.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Mia Wong>Perfect, thanks Sam.
